OL,3,AHuntingdon train attacker found guilty
OL,4,Aof all 14 counts of attempted murder
OL,5,
OL,6,FJudge Mr Justice Calver then said he
OL,7,Fwould accept majority verdicts -
OL,8,Fmeaning at least 10 of the 12 jurors
OL,9,Fmust agree
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/39
