OL,3,AUK net migration at lowest level since
OL,4,A1997 as asylum claims also fall
OL,5,
OL,6,FNet migration is a measure of how many
OL,7,Fextra people are added to the
OL,8,Fpopulation in a given year.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
