OL,3,AGerman boat dealer suspected of
OL,4,Asupplying Channel smuggling gangs, BBC
OL,5,Afinds
OL,6,
OL,7,FA German boat dealer is suspected by
OL,8,FEuropean authorities of being a key
OL,9,Fsupplier to migrant smugglers operating
OL,10,Fin the English Channel, the BBC can
OL,11,Freveal.
OL,13,FNearly a third of small-boat crossings
OL,14,Fin the first four months of this year
OL,15,Fallegedly involved boats or engines
OL,16,Ffrom MaReBoote, a small firm in western
OL,17,FGermany, according to files we have
OL,18,Fseen.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
