OL,3,AGerard Depardieu to stand trial for
OL,4,Aalleged rape of actress in 2018, court
OL,5,Arules
OL,6,
OL,7,FDepardieu, 77, had contested his
OL,8,Findictment on two counts of rape. In a
OL,9,Fletter published in Le Figaro in 2023,
OL,10,FDepardieu strongly denied Arnould's
OL,11,Fallegations, saying "there was never
OL,12,Fany coercion or violence between us".
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
